# Optional root-level overrides for the local Tilt stack. Unset or empty uses
# this checkout's generated apps-<key>.127.0.0.1.sslip.io domain. Set only the
# base zone (no `*.`); Tilt applies it to the Infrastructure provider and local
# preview Gateway. A Make command-line assignment overrides this file for one
# run: `make tilt RAILGRID_APP_BASE_DOMAIN=apps.example.com`.
# RAILGRID_APP_BASE_DOMAIN=apps.example.com

# Optional client-facing HTTPS port in generated app URLs. Leave unset to use
# Tilt's local preview listener port. Set empty when a trusted front proxy
# publishes standard HTTPS on port 443.
# RAILGRID_APP_PUBLIC_PORT=
